WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
The other thing that really sucks is the compounding errors.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.320
So if you have an agent that is 99% accurate,

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:11.120
across 50 tasks or something, that agent only becomes half accurate.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.200
So compounding errors are something that you have to pay attention to.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.960
Because if anything goes wrong, you—
